    "standard-dialogue": [
      {
        "npc": "You! Get to work!"
      },
      {
        "type": "choice",
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "What?",
            "steps": [
              {
                "player": "What?"
              },
              {
                "npc": "You are here to help work the blast furnace, aren't you?"
              },
              {
                "type": "choice",
                "options": [
                  {
                    "text": "What's the blast furnace?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "What's the blast furnace?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "The blast furnace is the pinnacle of dwarven metal- processing! Ore goes in the top and comes out as metal bars almost at once! And it's so efficient it only takes half as much coal to purify it as a regular furnace."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "But we've got a bit of a labour shortage at the moment, which is why I have to rely on immigrant workers to keep the furnace going. So, are you here to start work?"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "choice",
                        "options": [
                          {
                            "text": "How can I help work the blast furnace?",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "type": "jump",
                                "reference": "below",
                                "id": "SgAT2E"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Can I use the furnace to smelt ore?",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "type": "jump",
                                "reference": "below",
                                "id": "QFbvhb"
                              }
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "text": "Maybe some other time.",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "type": "jump",
                                "reference": "below",
                                "id": "6OScnP"
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "How can I help work the blast furnace?",
                    "steps": [
                      {
                        "player": "How can I help work the blast furnace?"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "The blast furnace will only work if there is a group of people keeping it going. Let me explain..."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "action",
                        "text": "(The Blast Furnace Plan interface opens, with the X next to the stove flashing.)",
                        "action": "open_interface",
                        "action_source": "text",
                        "target": "Blast Furnace Plan",
                        "id": "ykoAyT"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Firstly, the stove needs to be kept filled with coal. If this runs out the furnace will not work."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "action",
                        "text": "(The X next to the Air Pump starts flashing.)",
                        "id": "a8U561"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Secondly, someone needs to operate the pump that keeps the hot air blast circulating through the furnace."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "action",
                        "text": "(The X next to the Temp Gauge starts flashing.)",
                        "id": "9Dui2j"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Thirdly, someone needs to keep an eye on the temperature gauge. They should tell the pumper to start or stop so that the temperature stays in the right range."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "action",
                        "text": "(The X next to the Cogs starts flashing.)",
                        "id": "rEDqeE"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Lastly, someone needs to be on the pedals to power the conveyor belt that puts ore into the furnace."
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "Someone will also need to be on standby with a hammer in case the machine breaks!"
                      },
                      {
                        "npc": "While that's going, anyone else can put their ore on the conveyor belt to have it smelted."
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "action",
                        "text": "(The Blast Furnace Plan interface closes.)",
                        "id": "CtO8nb"
                      },
                      {
                        "type": "choice",
                        "options": [
                          {
                            "text": "So what do I get out of it?",
                            "steps": [
                              {
                                "player": "So what do I get out of it?"
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Keeping the furnace going is valuable experience in itself!"
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Keeping the stove alight will train your Firemaking, working the pump will train your Strength, pedalling the conveyor belt will train your Agility and repairing the furnace will train Crafting."
                              },
                              {
                                "npc": "Plus, everyone working the furnace will get a bit of experience in Smithing whenever anyone smelts ore in it."
                              },
                              {
                                "type": "choice",
                                "options": [
                                  {
                                    "text": "So I don't actually get paid then?",
                                    "steps": [
                                      {
                                        "player": "So I don't actually get paid then?"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "npc": "I offer you the privilege of working on the greatest example of dwarven engineering and you want to be PAID?"
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "npc": "If you co-operate with a group of people you can all get your smelting done pretty quickly. Or perhaps some humans who need to do some smelting will pay you, since you humans are all so obsessed with money."
                                      },
                                      {
                                        "type": "choice",
                                        "options": [
                                          {
                                            "text": "Okay, I'll get to work.",
