                                              },
                                              {
                                                "npc": "What would be the point of making money if I gave it all away to menial workers?"
                                              },
                                              {
                                                "npc": "I mean... Money isn't important! What about the greater glory of dwarven engineering? What about the satisfaction of helping others? What about the XP?"
                                              },
